\nThe Docker images are built from builds/<variant>/package.json, not from\nthe workspace root, so the bump in #4514 (root + module packages) never\nreached the deployed bundle: UAT kept serving the same\ndigit-ui.b4fbec1e.bundle.js with digit-ui-components 2.0.0-dev-64.\n\nBump all five variants (console, core-ui, dashboard-ui, payments-ui,\nworkbench-ui):\n- @egovernments/digit-ui-components 2.0.0-dev-64 -> 2.0.0-dev-65\n- @egovernments/digit-ui-module-core 2.0.0-dev-35 -> 2.0.0-dev-37\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"423dcd8defc44d3b98722ab5ef763841e64ea52b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/423dcd8defc44d3b98722ab5ef763841e64ea52b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/e0e1c2a37f281384a8e5fc1ef18d2890c4d941d4","verification":{"payload":"tree 423dcd8defc44d3b98722ab5ef763841e64ea52b\nparent 88635831d129cc86061b510a330c58e8787f0828\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1790061791 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790061791 +0530\n\nBUGFIX/HCMPRE-0000 : Bump digit-ui-components and module-core in the build manifests (#4523)\n\nBUGFIX/HCMPRE-0000 : Bump digit-ui-components and module-core in build manifests\n\nThe Docker images are built from builds/<variant>/package.json, not from\nthe workspace root, so the bump in #4514 (root + module packages) never\nreached the deployed bundle: UAT kept serving the same\ndigit-ui.b4fbec1e.bundle.js with digit-ui-components 2.0.0-dev-64.\n\nBump all five variants (console, core-ui, dashboard-ui, payments-ui,\nworkbench-ui):\n- @egovernments/digit-ui-components 2.0.0-dev-64 -> 2.0.0-dev-65\n- @egovernments/digit-ui-module-core 2.0.0-dev-35 -> 2.0.0-dev-37\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsizfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfJMQAGgzRqWc30QlCNz1aGgMBEUP\n2+D7E6TGodHSzcyq29BdUDZ3RK3X4y