ite_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/855bb65ec2faaf13f626f84ad85da6f5ea9c07fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T11:24:36Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T11:24:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Reflect an existing country code in the Show-country-code toggle (#4405)\n\nMobile-number fields seeded with prefixText \"+91\" showed the code in the\napp and preview while the drawer toggle read OFF, because the toggle only\nread showCountryCodeDropdown — a flag the forms engine never consumes.\nToggling ON also cleared prefixText, silently removing the code the app\nrenders.\n\nTreat a non-empty prefixText as ON for this toggle (state, and the\nconditional custom-prefix input), keep or seed \"+91\" when switching ON,\nand clear prefixText only when switching OFF.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd914174e5ec39cd64edbfd6d184636170c55425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/dd914174e5ec39cd64edbfd6d184636170c55425"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/855bb65ec2faaf13f626f84ad85da6f5ea9c07fd","verification":{"payload":"tree dd914174e5ec39cd64edbfd6d184636170c55425\nparent eb0aa35764c8334189bfe0dd1c9e81cd464a8d59\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788521076 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788521076 +0530\n\nReflect an existing country code in the Show-country-code toggle (#4405)\n\nMobile-number fields seeded with prefixText \"+91\" showed the code in the\napp and preview while the drawer toggle read OFF, because the toggle only\nread showCountryCodeDropdown — a flag the forms engine never consumes.\nToggling ON also cleared prefixText, silently removing the code the app\nrenders.\n\nTreat a non-empty prefixText as ON for this toggle (state, and the\nconditional custom-prefix input), keep or seed \"+91\" when switching ON,\nand clear prefixText only when switching OFF.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmqp0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATjgQACvevLuN7EroyZhbzmrvuOVj\nc0CceoPGROrTqMxF+QUj1FX+yIry1nfqD73iQvxiBfGLK9ReMSYFSob3zy9MyfJS\n+fqJ6Kr3o3mu+d8edM9U5gWM7R3yuibAC/RYg4do5u6Q9WrxbHWmjJWW56pxBKE3\nCFLPcE7FHGtww0kbcgsxRlXO2AfWI7hKrLVuJ1H2sE39NZV1vTIq1xmpbxLwWTak\nTIuhQU1+zP2WtAkBKabtYhXYYXgVfY83sn2wsLOilIKYRuEAyUK4sq3YpuiqTEvY\n3bjQsJc9EDFPkflEqCJ1tusLNbxNmZrHgqlqiLz25up6GdbmsoO1v8HMBh0hvayu\n4N7Q2ZbEZg+xNi2yc2y0gZKrQAt4DhZq4imHpWDUcE+tI15izb9VTAr7IYD1SUUu\n+kk410bhLykSy0vLkVVc7GWcFmtpXr0kRjGtTz+CeKfuOmbOaJsZFEIFw/+Z/oaN\nHCTqKaxUjUtFLtPqXb4seY43eZM7zJhoR7dj8iGCedvXGqQqcgVybAgSs8u1Uv9p\nc6+AZbV4Hr5KRKUszm0ANJ4z8NIua1jfoEmPFD3aKZTf1n4lFXpFBJPPMBDMy1UE\nTZ/a7DoIbikhIYrffM8xRPtf7SR2+s6nHHSJ0eCK/7lGt8xHCtY05CzNSrV92ZO6\nfNs1RzF40FQeVnUjrBuH\n=DrNg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-04T11:24:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0