 pages rendered the Buttons section as a bare label + input while\ntemplate pages show grey element-row cards — the footer label editor now\nsits in the same card with a Button tag, unifying the section styling\nacross Record Stock, Record Less/Excess, Household Registration and the\nother form pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b34b07ecbddeea83b487783bc1a9c78587fe4fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/b34b07ecbddeea83b487783bc1a9c78587fe4fd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/4d860bdbc4718b288275b923b37b799a116e8eaa","verification":{"payload":"tree b34b07ecbddeea83b487783bc1a9c78587fe4fd1\nparent 1e4699191777f2ecb9bbd1716d39eb897918f1a5\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788409230 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788409230 +0530\n\nAppConfig Buttons section: include popup-opening actions and card the form-page footer editor (#4389)\n\n* Group popup-opening actions under the Buttons section\n\nactionPopup and qrScanner rows render as buttons in the app (View QR,\nFilter, Sort, Download IDs), so they now join the Buttons section like\nplain buttons and footer rows do.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Card-style the footer button label editor on form pages\n\nForm pages rendered the Buttons section as a bare label + input while\ntemplate pages show grey element-row cards — the footer label editor now\nsits in the same card with a Button tag, unifying the section styling\nacross Record Stock, Record Less/Excess, Household Registration and the\nother form pages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthr