"message":"AppConfig: keep at least one menu card visible and un-clip the screen''s toasts (#4387)\n\n* Block hiding the last visible menu card on a menu screen\n\nA menu screen like Manage Stock with every menu card switched off would be\na dead end in the app, so the last visible menu card keeps the same\nguard-with-toast the last button already has.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Raise app-config toast above the phone preview and footer bar\n\nThe library toast is fixed-position with z-index 20, so on the app-config\nscreen it slid beneath the preview canvas (z-index 40-100) and the save\nfooter (1000), clipping the start of guard messages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Render the app-config toast outside the clipping preview container\n\nThe toast lived inside full-config-wrapper__container, whose\ncenter-content/preview-area scroll areas (overflow hidden/auto) clip\nfixed descendants in Chrome — the message was cut off at the canvas\nleft edge. Rendered as a sibling of the container instead; together\nwith the z-index raise it now sits fully above the preview.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Portal the app-config toast to body to escape preview clipping\n\nAppConfigurationWrapper''s toast (the one window.__appConfig_showToast\nactually drives) mounts inside the preview area, whose overflow\nhidden/auto containers clip fixed descendants — messages were cut off at\nthe canvas left edge. Rendering it through a portal to document.body\nshows the full message above the preview.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa7a10a2139e90fd7b5207d89b1df5aa30847497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/fa7a10a2139e90fd7b5207d89b1df5aa30847497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/1e4699191777f2ecb9bbd1716d39eb897918f1a5","verification":{"payload":"tree fa7a10a2139e90fd7b5207d89b1df5aa30847497\nparent 42a5a19040ecf9eb7268202d1a1127f0bcfcd562\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788359409 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788359409 +0530\n\nAppConfig: keep at least one menu card visible and un-clip the screen''s toasts (#4387)\n\n* Block hiding the last visible menu card on a menu screen\n\nA menu screen like Manage Stock with every menu card switched off would be\na dead end in the app, so the last visible menu card keeps the same\nguard-with-toast the last button already has.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Raise app-config toast above the phone preview and footer bar\n\nThe library toast is fixed-position with z-index 20, so on the app-config\nscreen it slid beneath the preview canvas (z-index 40-100) and the save\nfooter (1000), clipping the start of guard messages.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Render the app-config toast outside the clipping preview container\n\nThe toast lived inside full-config-wrapper__container, whose\ncenter-content/preview-area scroll areas (overflow hidden/auto) clip\nfixed descendants in Chrome — the message was cut off at the canvas\nleft edge. Rendered as a sibling of the container instead; together\nwith the z-index raise it now sits fully above the preview.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Portal the app-config toast to body to escape preview clipping\n\nAppConfigurationWrapper''s toast (the one window.__appConfig_showToast\nactually drives) mounts inside the preview area, whose overflow\nhidden/auto containers clip fixed descendants — messages were cut off at\nthe canvas left edge. Rendering it through a portal to document.body\nshows the full message above the preview.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmDLxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7ssQAAGnR2vBrRYtCgVKpEeyA/Bp\nccCqh0Wk5NIW/XDzE4MboTC0aOK8Cw08XxRdw9/YjuMHVZC/wJXDQqI3YZ6uKizm\nMlsa/94mNqJ+LkjbDZ5CmYFPNCvXZRqSRLVmJ7JyXrM9ykcjT0jK/I7WatX+UFOC\n5GVyTSAd7Wb/zGazbkuyQlAuMD5SO2h391JTUweei0BFE5ZsW2mPs9bSnTC8yQNC\nA8yIvDpzvWZPaPsLvuiAsEsPWovJnet0CTgxnEfYgtlZaQr8GqHBVhulZ68lAHGT\nAmSZEBmQh5P4ApJqB6TtkYuX++XWP/XtIorbb6E1wqAEWszie92RIvdYP/4B6ITH\n8GysYVBBufmqnCBnLM/X6f7zDOcnfkrxjyxLwalHeR6/wpxKxjOPYulCZE40j0oU\nCP503WbEmrgs9czJVUOyyGkr9SXjfdOl4DypQF5Mv0DzUbzuPqhWfkgvwbEez2Gb\nCHGNPfaOunkFSzgiK64fWh2TAF2bULkyE3BhBpF8bN8ZBqnyxWu4YCZaX9w258+6\neFoEb3y4SLiMYClarw2hCGBK78/xS4qeHQeOZp9Q0fdGJ6KPGMxUSOv3tDlRFRz2\noTgMe1jiZ5PQNMgyKTt/LeECz8/37obnVXpnw0skie2m6ggliK8Iln5j+kON4JUY\nf3TDDajABZ+585Z8jSxG\n=eIAS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T14:30:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url