s://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/a9ebbe1a626b028ae5369c0ee656f59787754519/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:32:59Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:32:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Buttons section: group all footer rows and drop redundant footer label inputs (#4382)\n\n* Hide footer label inputs when footer buttons render as element rows\n\nOn template pages the footer buttons already appear as clickable rows in\nthe Buttons section (label editable via Field properties), so the\nper-footer \"Primary action button label\" inputs duplicated that. Form\npages keep the inputs — they have no button rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Group all footer rows under the Buttons section, not just format=button\n\nFooter entries all render in the app''s bottom action bar, but the drawer\nonly grouped format=button rows there — Scan QR (qrScanner) and Download\nBeneficiary IDs (actionPopup) landed among the template elements instead.\nFooter-originated rows now always join the Buttons section, and count for\nthe last-visible-button guard and the footer-label dedupe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebf8bb6241f51ebf7677722bba77d2caf3b9c014","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/ebf8bb6241f51ebf7677722bba77d2caf3b9c014"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/a9ebbe1a626b028ae5369c0ee656f59787754519","verification":{"payload":"tree ebf8bb6241f51ebf7677722bba77d2caf3b9c014\nparent 5be3e6b4a64e36ac4aa3b42713de16ba739590f9\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788341579 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788341579 +0530\n\nButtons section: group all footer rows and drop redundant footer label inputs (#4382)\n\n* Hide footer label inputs when footer buttons render as element rows\n\nOn template pages the footer buttons already appear as clickable rows in\nthe Buttons section (label editable via Field properties), so the\nper-footer \"Primary action button label\" inputs duplicated that. Form\npages keep the inputs — they have no button rows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Group all footer rows under the Buttons section, not just format=button\n\nFooter entries all render in the app''s bottom action bar, but the drawer\nonly grouped format=button rows there — Scan QR (qrScanner) and Download\nBeneficiary IDs (actionPopup) landed among the template elements instead.\nFooter-originated rows now always join the Buttons section, and count for\nthe last-visible-button guard and the footer-label dedupe.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.c