NjI2YjAyOGFlNTM2OWMwZWU2NTZmNTk3ODc3NTQ1MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commit/5be3e6b4a64e36ac4aa3b42713de16ba739590f9","sha":"5be3e6b4a64e36ac4aa3b42713de16ba739590f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/5be3e6b4a64e36ac4aa3b42713de16ba739590f9"}],"sha":"a9ebbe1a626b028ae5369c0ee656f59787754519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/a9ebbe1a626b028ae5369c0ee656f59787754519"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83631045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveen-egov","id":83631045,"login":"naveen-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/5be3e6b4a64e36ac4aa3b42713de16ba739590f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:31:29Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T09:31:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Sentence-case, step-specific labels for the setup-campaign breadcrumb (#4377)\n\nName the boundary and delivery-strategy steps in the setup breadcrumb\n\nThe boundary (key 5-6) and delivery-strategy (key 7-9) steps are entered from\nseparate campaign-home cards but shared the generic \"Setup campaign\" crumb.\nPick the label from the step key so the trail names where the user actually is\n(CAMPAIGN_BREADCRUMB_SET_BOUNDARY / CAMPAIGN_BREADCRUMB_DELIVERY_STRATEGY).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a1c30e17b4c7ceaac3dd1165eb79e49969b5dca7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/a1c30e17b4c7ceaac3dd1165eb79e49969b5dca7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/5be3e6b4a64e36ac4aa3b42713de16ba739590f9","verification":{"payload":"tree a1c30e17b4c7ceaac3dd1165eb79e49969b5dca7\nparent 854808a5cfb4dec1a3591a358fa42259efb63846\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788341489 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788341489 +0530\n\nSentence-case, step-specific labels for the setup-campaign breadcrumb (#4377)\n\nName the boundary and delivery-strategy steps in the setup breadcrumb\n\nThe boundary (key 5-6) and delivery-strategy (key 7-9) steps are entered from\nseparate campaign-home cards but shared the generic \"Setup campaign\" crumb.\nPick the label from the step key so the trail names where the user actually is\n(CAMPAIGN_BREADCRUMB_SET_BOUNDARY / CAMPAIGN_BREADCRUMB_DELIVERY_STRATEGY).\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql+zxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhZsQAASRSCbMQYQQqR65gjU0qSjO\n++8b1+WBhOqgTCxLHyEkwU+rcjiXGmuHPULeX/OSOC+2y2M+CHH4YJm2oC+1dpKL\no0yYTeZHUuLyV