/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveen-egov","id":83631045,"login":"naveen-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/cc47f7229425bf5f9904dbc4d85a9555a43190a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:49:24Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:49:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Seed Edit Boundaries from the saved draft when session selection is empty (#4370)\n\nClicking Edit Boundaries after visiting other setup steps in the same SPA\nsession showed empty dropdowns: a leftover session entry with an empty\nselectedData both disabled the draft search (enabled: !hasSessionData) and\nwon the seeding branch. Treat an empty selection as \"no session data\" so the\nsaved draft populates the boundary screen; a hard refresh already behaved\nthis way because the in-memory store starts empty.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: talele08 <talele08@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d9fced0ceb234662f6780b0c39db24c559d0aaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/2d9fced0ceb234662f6780b0c39db24c559d0aaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/cc47f7229425bf5f9904dbc4d85a9555a43190a4","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d9fced0ceb234662f6780b0c39db24c559d0aaf\nparent a44b8dae7aa6a89bfffd6c3dc9f5164197cbd22f\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788194964 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788194964 +0530\n\nSeed Edit Boundaries from the saved draft when session selection is empty (#4370)\n\nClicking Edit Boundaries after visiting other setup steps in the same SPA\nsession showed empty dropdowns: a leftover session entry with an empty\nselectedData both disabled the draft search (enabled: !hasSessionData) and\nwon the seeding branch. Treat an empty selection as \"no session data\" so the\nsaved draft populates the boundary screen; a hard refresh already behaved\nthis way because the in-memory store starts empty.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: talele08 <talele08@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlbCUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARfoQABs08m6XnNAUGI+6Uxx2WpYt\nsIRg4PTiSUpwk8mQp/L11lWXX1d0x9pyRRleKqGHPxC7Y4mg/IyceN6L2DbbeVIY\n2U0ycvOFFGeGzmM6/8XIFz/ZGAKCO1X7jkhiqMbaJIiUorjX2pDBxbX/8w2UEfAI\nG1L5o1Yn9xx0wOYtpfe5h75e+wlz9hacV643ghQMuSB0EdBunkhu0D4pl/0a5JLm\nbQeD4YnIl/fEv1FJpXRRb3INedcKo2MsG+74D2hy/1S8Rfb5Fnl8OLyCOJ4DX64E\nwhs4s+kWaX+zc99Xql/szQ2U6QrXx4TD6djwhhfRZAqAb+Lh4MTd/8+1LEcr3Epx\nPj9PvQgaeZ9it6q+uafFUO2o13pq6JPM2EUhFGxfNEptxaoAFPEOyTaP0/aoV4rp\nOfmZVVkLrXSu500MMU4lv/ymw3dQrAC5a4EwSG1vQ8OOnJ74WjYc8/vB0w9Hjg47\nQCpduCDAQpJ3+3WWaPVCXpSs222uk0KPJSoja3dXJQm8XCLLKM4OhSa02hYeI76n\nC8YpOmfBTO2iXNTFQWO2lQNrFZ5HiW7JcSYTfgcYGvYxu1zWtISIgVRvro0rLPed\nPwYwecyvmXSjEXLTY0GFeknWZgsRQXZdi1HTOTVkKnjv7kNiyf7G