ng{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveen-egov","id":83631045,"login":"naveen-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/a44b8dae7aa6a89bfffd6c3dc9f5164197cbd22f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:04:54Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T16:04:54Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Close oversized label-to-field gaps in the resource configuration flow (#4368)\n\n* Tighten label column on the Add new resource screen\n\nThe Resource name/type/variant labels sat in a fixed 19rem column while the\ntext is ~8rem, leaving a large gap between each label and its input. Reduce\nthe column to 10rem so inputs sit next to their labels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Close the label-to-field gap in the Add Resource to Deliver popup\n\nBoth LabelFieldPairs in the popup stack the label above the field, but the\ncomponent class ships a horizontal-layout gap (spacer6), leaving ~2.5rem\nbetween \"Resources to be delivered\"/\"Count\" and their inputs. Override with\nthe vertical-layout gap (0.5rem, spacer2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af0fc41db9eb2d46b3dc38b3e2b8c10935397ae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/af0fc41db9eb2d46b3dc38b3e2b8c10935397ae8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/a44b8dae7aa6a89bfffd6c3dc9f5164197cbd22f","verification":{"payload":"tree af0fc41db9eb2d46b3dc38b3e2b8c10935397ae8\nparent 6e504647607d867f786c1b051b1dcb2d8471b498\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788192294 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788192294 +0530\n\nClose oversized label-to-field gaps in the resource configuration flow (#4368)\n\n* Tighten label column on the Add new resource screen\n\nThe Resource name/type/variant labels sat in a fixed 19rem column while the\ntext is ~8rem, leaving a large gap between each label and its input. Reduce\nthe column to 10rem so inputs sit next to their labels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n* Close the label-to-field gap in the Add Resource to Deliver popup\n\nBoth LabelFieldPairs in the popup stack the label above the field, but the\ncomponent class ships a horizontal-layout gap (spacer6), leaving ~2.5rem\nbetween \"Resources to be delivered\"/\"Count\" and their inputs. Override with\nthe vertical-layout gap (0.5rem, spacer2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlaYmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA+gQAJMkjhIBtIJruYhCmAh56YtL\neAFAoizUudc0oZIkp/q3o7sV5DOZOdCYruPnPHIqagiGXSH0Gyl+u7u6Ck4hsaMM\nu48Q8bPNlP1p7lvOTOLZH5C4Fo+n5lSpdDWhqSUA3iNpdfy