epos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/789d474884e58ed724e732b030d1a7a594202055/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:13:36Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T13:13:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Use the design-system Loader for bill generation in the attendance inbox (#4360)\n\nThe bill inbox rendered three different loading states, and the middle one used\n`LoaderWithGap` from the legacy `@egovernments/digit-ui-react-components` while\nits two neighbours used `Loader` from `@egovernments/digit-ui-components`. The\nlegacy component draws a small dark box with a CSS ring spinner and the word\n\"Loading\", whereas the design-system Loader is a branded Lottie animation over\na full-screen dim, so the loader visibly changed appearance depending on which\naction the user had triggered.\n\nSwitch it to the same `OverlayLoader` variant the adjacent bill-loading branch\nalready uses, since generating a bill is an in-place action rather than a page\nload, and drop the now-unused legacy import.\n\n`LoaderWithGap` is still used elsewhere in the repo (hcm-microplanning,\nmicroplan, and the older micro-ui copy of this file); those are left alone.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af951a83619aaa80dda6b3142f5926a06b0d6408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/af951a83619aaa80dda6b3142f5926a06b0d6408"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/789d474884e58ed724e732b030d1a7a594202055","verification":{"payload":"tree af951a83619aaa80dda6b3142f5926a06b0d6408\nparent befec50ae0880532a711aa24b0854cc3748312b3\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788182016 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788182016 +0530\n\nUse the design-system Loader for bill generation in the attendance inbox (#4360)\n\nThe bill inbox rendered three different loading states, and the middle one used\n`LoaderWithGap` from the legacy `@egovernments/digit-ui-react-components` while\nits two neighbours used `Loader` from `@egovernments/digit-ui-components`. The\nlegacy component draws a small dark box with a CSS ring spinner and the word\n\"Loading\", whereas the design-system Loader is a branded Lottie animation over\na full-screen dim, so the loader visibly changed appearance depending on which\naction the user had triggered.\n\nSwitch it to the same `OverlayLoader` variant the adjacent bill-loading branch\nalready uses, since generating a bill is an in-place action rather than a page\nload, and drop the now-unused legacy import.\n\n`LoaderWithGap` is still used elsewhere in the repo (hcm-microplanning,\nmicroplan, and the older micro-ui copy of this file); those are left alone.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015btqYRAL5QdStuMe3E47dp\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlX4ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyNwQABd144SzdabFY4b5YWafPq/1\nQ8Nki88l2XYniCnTrZYD+35XzjAdjfh+9apQdPXJP3pY3J55tL8JXeTgci5YbIrM\nEj4s1PLm90/4rckerjAf+CIu5EAqFI16E2lHouBgCqFU11Dlr/3mAJWTcboJOwQA\nkkNOtdbCMhuhmr5lUUDOU4+3MBjppn7o9L/RoT5NtGRo8ehxqspggLY/C91/46S8\nKO4YKg06FO8KCPRotvZYPpkUajNDB2xxo/Hu2MdajEA+liP/USroaYfGbH973Uva\nZ3akoIhjP5h1uZqL39187zvW4BMaYimoU+IOrnV+icPZKusF+wj6WE0lyXn1UMdu\nLmJffsjWR8IkE7WGvp9coQhSqti74uCebrfUbgEU4cRQXOQM9mu2uWqcjOfyw+3C\nVYIQ/xhjh/2+ld6oaNNugrTZc8MDMsGAKe0JfHmFk8fh/MwtgDSY5ahItJ7eEHJ3\ncFLLyj4hlR2VcNeV/6NTa5Qcu2Vit9dfcUPesjRMHftlzZDyvQSyAgEIPkuFBfxs\nBMKw8S+yOC3ysvs0FlyqmeBqlrRA6XdmuXb3OQ8d/et1y/wWt8d5Ht47lB6vOy+S\nVdA7gB728Bv5YW7ME/gUNHZymOwl/bQ7Iiwty/N4FpiB8Lek1Q15/gFP4i5ecenD\nVyFpOj7gKP/FO8NSph44\n=XU/p\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T13:13:37Z