rl":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commit/befec50ae0880532a711aa24b0854cc3748312b3","node_id":"C_kwDOKSe0RtoAKGJlZmVjNTBhZTA4ODA1MzJhNzExYWEyNGIwODU0Y2MzNzQ4MzEyYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commit/a7fb9ad3de53e9463331ad109a560eaa516d4b21","sha":"a7fb9ad3de53e9463331ad109a560eaa516d4b21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/a7fb9ad3de53e9463331ad109a560eaa516d4b21"}],"sha":"befec50ae0880532a711aa24b0854cc3748312b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/befec50ae0880532a711aa24b0854cc3748312b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83631045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveen-egov","id":83631045,"login":"naveen-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/a7fb9ad3de53e9463331ad109a560eaa516d4b21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:56:31Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:56:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Boundary screen: derive hierarchy from the campaign draft, not the global store (#4351)\n\nDon''t seed the boundary screen''s hierarchy from the global store\n\nHCM_CAMPAIGN_SELECTED_HIERARCHY is shared across campaigns, so opening\nDefine Target Areas after visiting a campaign with a different hierarchy\nbriefly ran with the stale hierarchy - fetching the wrong boundary tree\nand, on save, registering a hierarchy change that wiped the campaign''s\nconfigured boundaries. For an existing campaign the draft now supplies it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3804c4cecda5135dc024edd64bd07fdf10a5313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/e3804c4cecda5135dc024edd64bd07fdf10a5313"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/a7fb9ad3de53e9463331ad109a560eaa516d4b21","verification":{"payload":"tree e3804c4cecda5135dc024edd64bd07fdf10a5313\nparent a2999363f3adb639e2330f2f66ea86fd63372177\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1788155791 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788155791 +0530\n\nBoundary screen: derive hierarchy from the campaign draft, not the global store (#4351)\n\nDon''t seed the boundary screen''s hierarchy from the global store\n\nHCM_CAMPAIGN_SELECTED_HIERARCHY is shared across campaigns, so opening\nDefine Target Areas after visiting a campaign with a different hierarchy\nbriefly ran with the stale hierarchy - fetching the wrong boundary tree\nand, on save, registering a hierarchy change that wiped the campaign''s\nconfigured boundaries. For an existing campaign the draft now supplies it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@use