.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/931ba00bbb7a8401db1836f9548debd1b413a32a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:53:46Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:53:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show country code toggle: +91 fallback when CountryCodes master is empty (#4349)\n\n* Show country code toggle: fall back to +91 when CountryCodes master is empty\n\nThe library''s country-code dropdown renders nothing when the\ncommon-masters.CountryCodes MDMS master has no data, which made enabling\nthe toggle look like it did nothing (or hid the prefix input - perceived\nas reversed). Preview now shows a static +91 prefix in that case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show country code: prefix input belongs with the toggle ON (fallback parity)\n\nThe live FieldPropertiesPanelConfig MDMS record was patched the same way -\nthis keeps the bundled fallback consistent. Showing the Add prefix input\nwhen the toggle was OFF read as reversed behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Tags with runtime-expression labels show their element name in preview\n\nBeneficiary ID / Not eligible tags carry {{fn:...}} labels that only\nresolve in the app, so the preview rendered empty pills - fall back to\nthe localized fieldName (as shown in the panel), else mask with *****.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Drop the +91 preview fallback - no default country code anywhere\n\nPer review: the preview should not display a default code. The country\ncode shows only when a prefix is explicitly configured; the panel input\ncarries no default either.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Don''t offer the template download before the campaign fetch resolves\n\nA cloned campaign''s pre-filled sheet is only visible in campaign\nresources, which load async - deciding the popup earlier showed\n\"download template\" over an already-filled sheet on every first visit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show a page loader while the campaign fetch resolves on the upload screen\n\nPreviously the upload area rendered blank and the pre-filled sheet\npopped in after the async campaign search returned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9142e311eef49554e8804a413d39464af5e1838","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/f9142e311eef49554e8804a413d39464af5e1838"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/931ba00bbb7a8401db1836f9548debd1b413a32a","verification":{"payload":"tree f9142e311eef49554e8804a413d39464af5e1838\nparent b4b9ad6b507dc2478ef106946ab4bd65471685a0\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1787907226 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787907226 +0530\n\nShow country code toggle: +91 fallback when CountryCodes master is empty (#4349)\n\n* Show country code toggle: fall back to +91 when CountryCodes master is empty\n\nThe library''s country-code dropdown renders nothing when the\ncommon-masters.CountryCodes MDMS master has no data, which made enabling\nthe toggle look like it did nothing (or hid the prefix input - perceived\nas reversed). Preview now shows a static +91 prefix in that case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show country code: prefix input belongs with the toggle ON (fallback parity)\n\nThe live FieldPropertiesPanelConfig MDMS record was patched the same way -\nthis keeps the bundled fallback consistent. Showing the Add prefix input\nwhen the toggle was OFF read as reversed behaviour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Tags with runtime-expression labels show their element name in preview\n\nBeneficiary ID / Not eligible tags carry {{fn:...}} labels that only\nresolve in the app, so the preview rendered empty pills - fall back to\nthe localized fieldName (as shown in the panel), else mask with *****.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Drop the +91 preview fallback - no default country code anywhere\n\nPer review: the preview should not display a default code. The country\ncode shows only when a prefix is explicitly configured; the panel input\ncarries no default either.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Don''t offer the template download before the campaign fetch resolves\n\nA cloned campaign''s pre-filled sheet is only visible in campaign\nresources, which load async - deciding the popup earlier showed\n\"download template\" over an already-filled sheet on every first visit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Show a page loader while the campaign fetch resolves on the upload screen\n\nPreviously the upload area rendered blank and the pre-filled sheet\npopped in after the async campaign search returned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkUyaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJIEQAA6zs6RzValEawj19T4lnFeh\nGCgGKYT4hUD2rphTIVAIjGueCxdsNPmbS//GLB1K2rxP0GZyVEkW2XaC5EP86u29\nxx8RQnMRo6V6ayUG2MBVdbWsWtVSg0l2tWlIerobHvhmW0JsO19t4xSbCozmEqL/\nwCKzHpcrpYK+jxtWXBTxvnnbp0l144jHhp6rWr+Tb8lMHfAw/7ZmTik1rG1IAqZM\nKihufFm/oM7vupiS8OAzl0N8kdice9e/5P1Sc8sO4OPajXpoy1BrvBBb8LVdmRQ+\nW4PvK8xN+xi6hhcSS2h811OCjpx0eWMHsn30iLqKQQWJqIm2Byo9EQRDiGmBfrXi\nvMk7wk3T9kQFRArp151FGr55YGHaRLCumHt3lHHBugha20NoCFeUZCDr9WD8Y/VG\njAq1A7NU8nk+rjW0kxiFUDBfg9fVqC7NsKwmZlKyZ6RvqlQOVqBJ6+AY4dDIwcc3\nMLFjt5QfY8mXkPUFk+/75HZamBkfJXM/kfCYaPLikb/oq/l/cmG4lDRsfARPP2qV\ns7IRh3FLna/qRqHmbL