y}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveen-egov","id":83631045,"login":"naveen-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/7d79143824fe8cc3d12b0e7e4e0a7ae5b344f34b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:34:28Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T06:34:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"FEATURE/HCMPRE-0000 : Campaign scoped flow labels + app config popup editor fixes (#4325)\n\n* FEATURE : Translate app config flow/page/category labels from campaign localization module\n\nSidebar flow names, page tabs and the flow tag in FullConfigWrapper resolved\nonly from the global i18next store (shared modules), so campaign-specific\nrenames like polio''s Redose -> Revisit never applied. Translate these labels\nfrom the campaign''s own localization module (appConfigStore localization\nslice) first and fall back to the global t.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FIX : Popup footer buttons full width in app config mobile preview\n\nThe phone preview is a narrow scaled container inside a desktop viewport,\nso the popup component''s mobile media queries never fire and the footer\nbuttons rendered right-aligned with empty space on the left. Scope the\nmobile layout (full-width row, equal flex buttons) to .zoom-content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FIX : Expose popup description property in app config field editor\n\nThe preview renders popupConfig.description but PopUpConfigEditor never\nshowed an input for it, so the description could not be edited from the\nright-side panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* REVERT : Drop preview popup css change from legacy micro-ui copy\n\nOnly micro-ui-react19 hosts the app config redesign; css version bump\nwill be handled separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"90acd4b5504152907f68534a729c629159fb3199","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/90acd4b5504152907f68534a729c629159fb3199"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/7d79143824fe8cc3d12b0e7e4e0a7ae5b344f34b","verification":{"payload":"tree 90acd4b5504152907f68534a729c629159fb3199\nparent b823129f961ca353b7223b0f36cf27fa903432d9\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1787639668 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787639668 +0530\n\nFEATURE/HCMPRE-0000 : Campaign scoped flow labels + app config popup editor fixes (#4325)\n\n* FEATURE : Translate app config flow/page/category labels from campaign localization module\n\nSidebar flow names, page tabs and the flow tag in FullConfigWrapper resolved\nonly from the global i18next store (shared modules), so campaign-specific\nrenames like polio''s Redose -> Revisit never applied. Translate these labels\nfrom the campaign''s own localization module (appConfigStore localization\nslice) first and fall back to the global t.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FIX : Popup footer buttons full width in app config mobile preview\n\nThe phone preview is a narrow scaled container inside a desktop viewport,\nso the popup component''s mobile media queries never fire and the footer\nbuttons rendered right-aligned with empty space on the left. Scope the\nmobile layout (full-width row, equal flex buttons) to .zoom-content.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FIX : Expose popup description property in app config field editor\n\nThe preview renders popupConfig.description but PopUpConfigEditor never\nshowed an input for it, so the description could not be edited from the\nright-side panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* REVERT : Drop preview popup css change from legacy micro-ui copy\n\nOnly micro-ui-react19 hosts the app config redesign; css version bump\nwill be handled separately.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjTd0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvW4QAK7JA83j6/hgIHutAGPiNrP7\nYYHnOa2Fs6y3khjrIm8DnCNwSXxaSFBR7Ke9xAYaQI0IlhjvGVuO2Lsd+l6on2qv\ni7GpWJqKufZbrXunI2723oCmdrByrMGerN3Jkrg3sS3ycCd1lMYbC88jYH36eO6t\n2vOS9YW7PfwI/ycJToxrr+Gk7moafJ41wfe4odZuEG2+UM/wdskGrx35e0OlAGaz\nZsI6OvPIvOmd7LwkB+x/q2GAe30zc6t/7TyOi5iygULtO6n8TTlNykfOAG5RyZ9m\ntjLcremuidZsP8lgBe4fVyBzxfx1XjCtfu+GQvf0qUN9QphBM/6+XdIIRo7Tet74\nFDOELaHizBztdwwEI7neUEMqITeIvhy4JqbGP1cSbkNCOiljvhKsE2R0RiLEaCC6\n6sRhyrcSW2SI6SRzO8abwPLxK50aKGUbICjwGZNilLDMX1Fwl6zOUchUeJrpQydF\ndfpedi62jJmY1AyqiEk0ErC1ZvgVFY90PGUuTKz2V4rKQgekQKLbcjzGRUpbmzNQ\naOCyapjP+X7ROc9bN7XqBWGOTR5J+XmZ5rD5rOKfqZqEexAehpWM4MuzdDIn62aP\nNr+sYoUCw041fBSzwdSJbzU8yq5WGhN2apI8t07s31mu8fCZQvhyHnK3uRKciR4F\nX/youCNlTT3kYaJ54vcw\n=qSnx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE--