avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83631045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveen-egov","id":83631045,"login":"naveen-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/9e2f0f083a015d44d5a595388e0508bd6f99fbfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T13:44:58Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T13:44:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"FEATURE: AppConfig checklist and table drawer UX improvements (#4305)\n\nChecklist preview (per HCM App Enhancement design):\n- Question labels use Heading S - Mobile typography: 16px, bold,\n  primary (black) text. Set in px because the app root font-size is\n  90%, so 1rem computes to 14.4px.\n- Dividers between consecutive questions (1px, none before the first).\n- A page is treated as a checklist when its flow is CHECKLIST or its\n  localized heading contains \"Checklist\" (covers the HFREFERRAL\n  side-effect/fever/sick checklist pages), applied in both preview\n  renderers (AppPreview and NewLayoutRenderer).\n- Standalone checklist module preview question size bumped 14px -> 16px.\n\nTable field drawer (side panel):\n- Each table column (label + visibility toggle + localization input)\n  renders as its own white bordered sub-group card on the grey drawer\n  container, scoped to table columns only.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"67101548981aa87d9f1f2bf99fd140f609f94b84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/67101548981aa87d9f1f2bf99fd140f609f94b84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/9e2f0f083a015d44d5a595388e0508bd6f99fbfb","verification":{"payload":"tree 67101548981aa87d9f1f2bf99fd140f609f94b84\nparent 2e29d499f8a25089820188a0556797a61fff1252\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1787233498 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787233498 +0530\n\nFEATURE: AppConfig checklist and table drawer UX improvements (#4305)\n\nChecklist preview (per HCM App Enhancement design):\n- Question labels use Heading S - Mobile typography: 16px, bold,\n  primary (black) text. Set in px because the app root font-size is\n  90%, so 1rem computes to 14.4px.\n- Dividers between consecutive questions (1px, none before the first).\n- A page is treated as a checklist when its flow is CHECKLIST or its\n  localized heading contains \"Checklist\" (covers the HFREFERRAL\n  side-effect/fever/sick checklist pages), applied in both preview\n  renderers (AppPreview and NewLayoutRenderer).\n- Standalone checklist module preview question size bumped 14px -> 16px.\n\nTable field drawer (side panel):\n- Each table column (label + visibility toggle + localization input)\n  renders as its own white bordered sub-group card on the grey drawer\n  container, scoped to table columns only.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid