ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commit/015f85dd778bdc75fe0cab687b7140e2e607d29b","node_id":"C_kwDOKSe0RtoAKDAxNWY4NWRkNzc4YmRjNzVmZTBjYWI2ODdiNzE0MGUyZTYwN2QyOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commit/bcf1324d33cbb030f099ecf5ce43bc425d64c578","sha":"bcf1324d33cbb030f099ecf5ce43bc425d64c578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/bcf1324d33cbb030f099ecf5ce43bc425d64c578"}],"sha":"015f85dd778bdc75fe0cab687b7140e2e607d29b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/015f85dd778bdc75fe0cab687b7140e2e607d29b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83631045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/naveen-egov","id":83631045,"login":"naveen-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjMxMDQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/naveen-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/bcf1324d33cbb030f099ecf5ce43bc425d64c578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:17:05Z","email":"83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Naveen J"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T09:17:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"FEATURE : Fix app preview row sizing and tertiary button alignment (#4268)\n\n* FEATURE : Restrict field type dropdown to compatible types in AppConfig v2\n\nThe field type dropdown in NewDrawerFieldComposer now only offers types\ncompatible with the currently selected field, driven by an optional\ncompatibleTypes array on each HCM-ADMIN-CONSOLE.FieldTypeMappingConfig\nentry, with a fallback to matching the field''s data type (metadata.type).\nPrevents conversions the field worker app''s data model cannot store\n(e.g. a Date of Birth field becoming a Checkbox).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE : Fix app preview row sizing and tertiary button alignment\n\nTertiary buttons no longer inherit the footer''s margin-top:auto, so text\nactions like Filter center vertically against adjacent inputs. Row\nchildren now size by content: action-like formats (button, actionPopup,\nicon, tag) hug their content while other fields share the remaining row\nwidth, so search bars stretch instead of splitting the row 50/50 with a\nsmall text button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f72fc54144fb797d9dbea1e689db1e38991ebc0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/f72fc54144fb797d9dbea1e689db1e38991ebc0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/bcf1324d33cbb030f099ecf5ce43bc425d64c578","verification":{"payload":"tree f72fc54144fb797d9dbea1e689db1e38991ebc0f\nparent b57620e800dc8d05be978c03c9c3c89967992155\nauthor Naveen J <83631045+naveen-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1786958225 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786958225 +0530\n\nFEATURE : Fix app preview row sizing and tertiary button alignment (#4268)\n\n* FEATURE : Restrict field type dropdown to compatible types in AppConfig v2\n\nThe field type dropdown in NewDrawerFieldComposer now only offers types\ncompatible with the currently selected field, driven by an optional\ncompatibleTypes array on each HCM-ADMIN-CONSOLE.FieldTypeMappingConfig\nentry, with a fallback to matching the field''s data type (metadata.type).\nPrevents conversions the field worker app''s data model cannot store\n(e.g. a Date of Birth field becoming a Checkbox).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE : Fix app preview row sizing and tertiary button alignment\n\nTertiary buttons no longer inherit the footer''s margin-top:auto, so text\nactions like Filter center vertically against adjacent inputs. Row\nchildren now size by content: action-like formats (button, actionPopup,\nicon, tag) hug their content while other fields share the remaining row\nwidth, so search bars stretch instead of splitting the row 50/50 with a\nsmall text button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqgtGRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHosQAHWrjFkrvIIGdebOa1UBQXoY\nl4hKYz9l8LrvyGYhJacj9+xO65n1hB2cGkrUK+2HIdiV7aCDisn9WmcCYaoOu1U7\naqRZXUZtG54IJW3K+8KLKA2b9Fum8g8J6LN8Fa9VY5d94/nZCbluz6DbZi5IoZmA\nri5Nc31fv0Fdg1LgPQQZyLxsXcn2Q6b5DxtClcs1pjiS+5KP4qOJd1enEDj0TIBy\nt2qLawZty8gjVs/DmEiCnKrkuqoftUK+fMDXagzQOTIaRX/e6iOr5Gr6INUhw9YC\nTUKXkwm+HdaLJ+T3ZuAePuETp3kRc6iVQHTGK70dx4uyB+A9zNmQQzmyEm7MgCIB\nAWO5ASCSPF4ALYmZNNpPvHDdMsxMp/IEiiizx60P+k3f8SLY1uPXyWMwFN7RyAd7\nmT/shkZlazCT2k4nXjgW03q3sL3phA/VAuPGT5bcN+Yt1kcz99a0SdNH9SlJPQi6\nfHOlQXnY2qkYhnCmUBmdiuwWWHqtX5yeDMWqGzwfKZIEnXbG00aCwWQukOX37Ymy\nH6QqJ7vK7+RHTtruNgKE7WVpTQ5UN50CRpaEiW3jnIgtJyXrNcekmo5rS69TaJuB\nx0cMzYHeyQB8VwFUJ8Nc45k9Lhvy5ZZtYwQ4e6sYtzF/HU8EoeGmzs425CCrI7HC\nIhNQ