es for all modules\n\n* Added complete release notes docs\n\n* Resolved code rabbit comments\n\n* Removed attendance card before campaign creation\n\n* Fixed gap between label and field in delivery rules\n\n* Fixed chip hover effect\n\n* Fixed header fonts\n\n* Delivery rules screen issue fixes\n\n* Campaign template screen fixes\n\n* Stock resources issue fix\n\n* CSS version update","tree":{"sha":"2c783c35fbd56cfc32b16b190364d9baf857262b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/2c783c35fbd56cfc32b16b190364d9baf857262b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/c5626e66b557d5a8fa817bafe68c64e8e909cb95","verification":{"payload":"tree 2c783c35fbd56cfc32b16b190364d9baf857262b\nparent af101cedde78413e5520fe95dccb3512f32b3ca4\nauthor Swathi-eGov <137176788+Swathi-eGov@users.noreply.github.com> 1786077770 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786077770 +0530\n\nFEATURE/HCMPRE-4231 : Reports configured for a specific campaign will be shown in dashboard (#4232)\n\n* Only configured reports made visible in dashboard\n\n* Added complete release notes for all modules\n\n* Added complete release notes docs\n\n* Resolved code rabbit comments\n\n* Removed attendance card before campaign creation\n\n* Fixed gap between label and field in delivery rules\n\n* Fixed chip hover effect\n\n* Fixed header fonts\n\n* Delivery rules screen issue fixes\n\n* Campaign template screen fixes\n\n* Stock resources issue fix\n\n* CSS version update","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdWJKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK1kQACiD48fXTZVrW9eufKr8VFOb\nGCLdqfxxJcn9Q8EPgy5THT5PPLtEHux0ebyBouBrVdj3oAO1pyz9G/TLtmg3jCDz\nn6150KmGd5wIaBtZisVdXvVcxtgHeCnapd9nDr7ZG6tb8OMbqIKi528C2nfx9Lxs\nM2C8arI58+b+lfeA7nKVf5WMy4AvI/r0/s1rLDuHjR1ZxUdueZfAmiCoByckXcTJ\ngCnWs+Pl6kBtPlhadiWCq7gbm8laz8P6oH9DlEQfihPFhtZJkruoe5MyBwYTxNiC\nZl7gdqz52xWQla9qZ2xkiiDmHERlehnAF8X+fQAB14Xo5/faddk3TX9jhxPKpTJI\n4c0h5251jf88rLzWa+f+