ltValue in app config preview for numeric field types\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-3662 : CodeRabbit fixes, boundary Select All and frozen data merge fixes\n\n- Use campaignStore.dispatch instead of useDispatch for campaign state resets\n- Add campaignNumber guard to prevent resetting existing campaign data\n- Fix stale campaign reset for new campaigns with null ID\n- Accept string numeric defaults in ComponentToRender preview\n- Use resolved dateRange for campaign date tags, validate formatted output\n- Fix handleSelectAll passing stale state to onSelect callback\n- Fix frozen data re-merging cleared children on parent re-selection","tree":{"sha":"9023093ab8a2c5c06b4d15962e150e49c6ebaa1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/9023093ab8a2c5c06b4d15962e150e49c6ebaa1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/e03f5ab9a257ebf003c97ce3fc353f3a37555713","verification":{"payload":"tree 9023093ab8a2c5c06b4d15962e150e49c6ebaa1b\nparent 11a0d73767ee9e667d01175ada7818021738fafe\nauthor Ramkrishna-egov <85437265+Ramkrishna-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1785733942 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785733942 +0530\n\nBUGFIX/HCMPRE-3662: Campaign creation fixes - hierarchy popup, delivery rules, UI improvements (#4221)\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-3662 : Campaign creation fixes - hierarchy popup, delivery rules persistence, UI improvements\n\n- Fix hierarchy change popup showing incorrectly when no boundaries are selected\n- Persist delivery rules in Redux across navigation to add-product page\n- Drive Single/Multi Round radio buttons from MDMS roundTypes config\n- Replace campaign name tag with dates tag on cycle config and delivery rules pages\n- Fix stale campaign state when creating new campaign from scratch\n- Restrict campaign name to 30 chars and delivery rule values to 10 chars\n- Remove sort icon from commodity campaign inbox\n- Show defaultValue in app config preview for numeric field types\n\n* BUGFIX/HC