":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/96454c755139e24b353d082a48df5f6c97853ec4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T04:03:50Z","email":"85437265+Ramkrishna-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ramkrishna-egov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T04:03:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix boundary selection page performance, dropdown rendering, and Select All reset (#4215)\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix Select All not resetting on parent dropdown clear, add hierarchy API caching\n\nReset selectAllChecked and categorySelected when selected prop becomes empty\nso child dropdowns properly clear when parent is cleared.\nMove clear logic out of startTransition for immediate child state propagation.\nAdd cacheTime and staleTime to hierarchy definition API to avoid redundant calls.\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix boundary selection page performance and dropdown rendering\n\n- Add unified async pipeline with time-based yielding for boundary data processing to keep loader animation smooth\n- Fix child dropdowns not populating in new campaign flow by adding post-pipeline optionsPerType recomputation\n- Fix double scrollbar in MultiSelectDropdown by overriding outer container overflow\n- Optimize flattenOptions from O(n²) concat to O(n) push and add pre-built child index cache\n- Add API caching (staleTime/cacheTime) to prevent redundant background refetches\n- Guard parent-echo sync effect to prevent infinite loop and state override after pipeline completion\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Address CodeRabbit review feedback\n\n- Fix selectedSyncKey to use rolling hash instead of bookend codes to detect mid-list replacements\n- Fix flattenOptions to always shallow copy on first insertion preventing caller mutation\n- Fix parent echo guard to use reference comparison allowing genuine parent resets\n- Move frozenData/frozenType/restrictSelection to refs to avoid unnecessary pipeline restarts\n- Add console.warn on invalid boundaryData bailout and set pipelineDoneRef\n- Replace cacheTime with gcTime for TanStack Query v5 compatibility\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix stale optionsPerType when props change during pipeline execution","tree":{"sha":"e5cb1f54314c9c57b90b2d738cac2d96532c9d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/e5cb1f54314c9c57b90b2d738cac2d96532c9d3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/96454c755139e24b353d082a48df5f6c97853ec4","verification":{"payload":"tree e5cb1f54314c9c57b90b2d738cac2d96532c9d3c\nparent ee6026665804313b32212acf32c70d47be8506b8\nauthor Ramkrishna-egov <85437265+Ramkrishna-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1785384230 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785384230 +0530\n\nBUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix boundary selection page performance, dropdown rendering, and Select All reset (#4215)\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix Select All not resetting on parent dropdown clear, add hierarchy API caching\n\nReset selectAllChecked and categorySelected when selected prop becomes empty\nso child dropdowns properly clear when parent is cleared.\nMove clear logic out of startTransition for immediate child state propagation.\nAdd cacheTime and staleTime to hierarchy definition API to avoid redundant calls.\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix boundary selection page performance and dropdown rendering\n\n- Add unified async pipeline with time-based yielding for boundary data processing to keep loader animation smooth\n- Fix child dropdowns not populating in new campaign flow by adding post-pipeline optionsPerType recomputation\n- Fix double scrollbar in MultiSelectDropdown by overriding outer container overflow\n- Optimize flattenOptions from O(n²) concat to O(n) push and add pre-built child index cache\n- Add API caching (staleTime/cacheTime) to prevent redundant background refetches\n- Guard parent-echo sync effect to prevent infinite loop and state override after pipeline completion\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Address CodeRabbit review feedback\n\n- Fix selectedSyncKey to use rolling hash instead of bookend codes to detect mid-list replacements\n- Fix flattenOptions to always shallow copy on first insertion preventing caller mutation\n- Fix parent echo guard to use reference comparison allowing genuine parent resets\n- Move frozenData/frozenType/restrictSelection to refs to avoid unnecessary pipeline restarts\n- Add console.warn on invalid boundaryData bailout and set pipelineDoneRef\n- Replace cacheTime with gcTime for TanStack Query v5 compatibility\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-8282 : Fix stale optionsPerType when props change during pipeline execution","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqas0mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtaIQAIG1BqboTMTcuNwz5d7bYSgs\ngNEmhlD217WrxXcZNq0pC8GdFYL2gcUFXlH4F55H94A0kVhaM6r54Bi/T4HW1SWz\ntewRswyZu3Jc5zdlz634GX1OEBJlqoe7SMZnb7n60IuXe80YNwQJRVv1IOahrhQn\nYR1V+I46Lr6cP3fUmY7+XudVguGXTtYmJNEFf/7MzJ4/43tc5oQAsr59m64LCQdo\nepAA4a9GBPkEci2jNtZOAxfuoKn12ci79ZFskeoJjdPMrYBjlbNubeVudMBJte9q\nfB/E0Aq86ua1LvXj8efPJY/eY3CT5C266iqia1zf12OkSzOft7BlafvIHyUQVuEM\nOPU7UBwAKJHYRu5JLnpF3pPgtQkHXLZgiTG4rBfJPa20X1sKyV/3EcFRN8Yeev1O\nTqhPiCaaTsLiWSFOQQDLiLnc0pExU/e90+8/fxiRU3zABGMqb7xkGmgqgpCEV3U6\nd+i3guM5un6jNmDNNsDmGifGmhiTodQJ8CAEqEtKM32u4UNgIOu8rJKZJ9R1CzeZ\nTJOJpo9XXdqLMDStLuS8Y4PYKhlb8SmhIQStmVEP/1zxOtVW4j9ArrLg/cgDMrV5\nzv4iz7ZFhjnyfQ04eN+nPbn4KVHHPMjKFSbhY2ygOLwiCA1txRDZLNCQ1y27YKtj\n0x1lzagNTgkZnkor9uRb\n=caCE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-30T04:03:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubus