YmZhZjVmY2YzYjU0OGZhZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commit/1ff404a8e3b0e218caf27dc654f57c5dd220c68e","sha":"1ff404a8e3b0e218caf27dc654f57c5dd220c68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/1ff404a8e3b0e218caf27dc654f57c5dd220c68e"}],"sha":"7e48f1fbffcaa646a6aa920bfaf5fcf3b548fafb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/7e48f1fbffcaa646a6aa920bfaf5fcf3b548fafb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85437265?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ramkrishna-egov","id":85437265,"login":"Ramkrishna-egov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM3MjY1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/1ff404a8e3b0e218caf27dc654f57c5dd220c68e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:40:37Z","email":"85437265+Ramkrishna-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ramkrishna-egov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T09:40:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Consolidate campaign state, fix crashes, optimize boundary performance (#4170)\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Consolidate campaign state, fix crashes, and optimize boundary selection performance\n\nState consolidation:\n- Replace 16 IndexedDB keys and 7 Redux slices with 1 IndexedDB key and 4 slices\n- Merge 3 duplicate keys (FORM_DATA, ADMIN_SETUP, ADMIN_UPLOAD) into single campaign.formData\n- Single debounced write-back to IndexedDB via CAMPAIGN_APP_STATE key\n- UI-only state (timelinePopup, campaignNameInfo, campaignNumber) no longer persisted\n\nBug fixes:\n- Fix DeliverySetupContainer crash caused by nested Redux Provider shadowing campaign store\n  (useCampaignStore now uses useSyncExternalStore bound to campaignStore singleton)\n- Fix empty module localization search call on boundary selection page\n  (moved useCampaignStore hooks above hierarchyType computation, added enabled guard)\n- Remove redundant duplicate writes in CampaignDetails.js (setAdminSetup, setFormData)\n\nPerformance fixes for boundary selection with 50k+ boundaries:\n- Wire up useDeferredValue for search filtering (was declared but never used)\n- Memoize filteredOptions, parentOptionsWithChildren, and optionsPerType\n- Replace O(n*m) selected-state checks with O(1) Set lookups (selectedCodesSet)\n- Replace O(n*m) child boundary lookup with pre-built reverse index (O(n))\n- Replace O(n^2) tree walk with parent-children Map index (O(n))\n- Add useTransition with loader overlay during heavy selection processing\n- Pre-compute selectedPerType grouped by boundary type\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix stale campaign data across flows and harden store cleanup\n\n- Clear store on route changes (not just mount) in index.js, gated on hydration\n- Clear stale formData in SetupCampaign before draft loads when id present\n- Reset store in CampaignDetails on mount for view-details navigation\n- Clear metadata params in CreateCampaign on mount for new campaigns\n- Clear store in CloneCampaignWrapper before navigating after clone success\n- Fix CycleConfiguration wrong data path dropping persisted cycle data\n- Remove dangerous pre-validation clearAdminSetup that wiped all formData\n- Remove redundant clearAdminUploadData calls in SetupCampaign/UpdateCampaign\n- Use useCampaignStore hook callbacks in SelectHierarchy instead of useDispatch\n- Fix write-back to only advance previousState after IndexedDB write succeeds\n- Fix IndexedDB operations to resolve on transaction.oncomplete\n- Fix UploadDataMapping wrong store key\n- Fix useCampaignStore functional updater support\n- Reset store in UpdateCampaign onSuccess before navigation\n- Add hierarchy/hierarchyCode clearing to resetCreateCampaignData\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Optimize 55k boundary selection performance and fix re-entry loader freeze\n\nShow loader during Select All and on re-entering boundary selection with\nlarge pre-existing data. Key fixes: batch state updates in handleSelectAll\nand handleCategorySelection, iterative processData instead of recursive\nO(n²) spread, batched updateBoundaryOptions into single setState, deferred\nmount rendering with double-rAF, removed expensive JSON.stringify on every\nrender.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix substring match in updateBoundaryOptions path comparison\n\nUse split(\".\").includes(code) instead of includes(code) to match\ncomplete path segments and prevent false positives (e.g., parent code\n\"12\" incorrectly matching path \"112.abc\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix single-select duplicate codes and preserve frozen selections on bulk deselect\n\nUse boundary key (subkey) as option code in single-select dropdown\ninstead of parent code from path split, preventing sibling boundaries\nfrom sharing the same code. Preserve frozen selections during Deselect\nAll and category deselection by checking frozenCodesSet before removal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Remove globalConfig hierarchyType dependency from health-payments module\n\nDerive hierarchyType from project.additionalDetails and lowestBoundaryLevel\nfrom boundary hierarchy definition API instead of hardcoding from\nwindow.globalConfigs and paymentsConfig MDMS. Pass both values via React\nContext (ProviderContext) and load boundary localizations at screen level.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Add input validation and character limits for drawer field properties and page headers\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix CodeRabbit review issues - move number min clamping to blur, connect virtualized list keyboard nav, clean up unused import\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix dropdown scrollbar for single option and Select All state sync on boundary clear\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Add polling for campaign search persistence verification after delivery rules update and unified sheet upload\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Add boundary summary persistence polling and fix dropdown scrollbar\n\n- Add persistence polling to BoundarySummary (key=6) with fingerprint comparison\n  against update request payload, retrying up to 3 times with 5-second gaps\n- Store boundary fingerprint in SetupCampaign before calling update API\n- Fix horizontal scrollbar in MultiSelectDropdown by adding overflowX hidden to\n  react-window List component\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec799fffa9486e390e97ec0b0f2d1acaf1a66cd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/ec799fffa9486e390e97ec0b0f2d1acaf1a66cd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/1ff404a8e3b0e218caf27dc654f57c5dd220c68e","verification":{"payload":"tree ec799fffa9486e390e97ec0b0f2d1acaf1a66cd4\nparent b4dd0dd949f82eabbbdc8e976fba27d732e0bbb6\nauthor Ramkrishna-egov <85437265+Ramkrishna-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1784540437 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784540437 +0530\n\nFEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Consolidate campaign state, fix crashes, optimize boundary performance (#4170)\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Consolidate campaign state, fix crashes, and optimize boundary selection performance\n\nState consolidation:\n- Replace 16 IndexedDB keys and 7 Redux slices with 1 IndexedDB key and 4 slices\n- Merge 3 duplicate keys (FORM_DATA, ADMIN_SETUP, ADMIN_UPLOAD) into single campaign.formData\n- Single debounced write-back to IndexedDB via CAMPAIGN_APP_STATE key\n- UI-only state (timelinePopup, campaignNameInfo, campaignNumber) no longer persisted\n\nBug fixes:\n- Fix DeliverySetupContainer crash caused by nested Redux Provider shadowing campaign store\n  (useCampaignStore now uses useSyncExternalStore bound to campaignStore singleton)\n- Fix empty module localization search call on boundary selection page\n  (moved useCampaignStore hooks above hierarchyType computation, added enabled guard)\n- Remove redundant duplicate writes in CampaignDetails.js (setAdminSetup, setFormData)\n\nPerformance fixes for boundary selection with 50k+ boundaries:\n- Wire up useDeferredValue for search filtering (was declared but never used)\n- Memoize filteredOptions, parentOptionsWithChildren, and optionsPerType\n- Replace O(n*m) selected-state checks with O(1) Set lookups (selectedCodesSet)\n- Replace O(n*m) child boundary lookup with pre-built reverse index (O(n))\n- Replace O(n^2) tree walk with parent-children Map index (O(n))\n- Add useTransition with loader overlay during heavy selection processing\n- Pre-compute selectedPerType grouped by boundary type\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix stale campaign data across flows and harden store cleanup\n\n- Clear store on route changes (not just mount) in index.js, gated on hydration\n- Clear stale formData in SetupCampaign before draft loads when id present\n- Reset store in CampaignDetails on mount for view-details navigation\n- Clear metadata params in CreateCampaign on mount for new campaigns\n- Clear store in CloneCampaignWrapper before navigating after clone success\n- Fix CycleConfiguration wrong data path dropping persisted cycle data\n- Remove dangerous pre-validation clearAdminSetup that wiped all formData\n- Remove redundant clearAdminUploadData calls in SetupCampaign/UpdateCampaign\n- Use useCampaignStore hook callbacks in SelectHierarchy instead of useDispatch\n- Fix write-back to only advance previousState after IndexedDB write succeeds\n- Fix IndexedDB operations to resolve on transaction.oncomplete\n- Fix UploadDataMapping wrong store key\n- Fix useCampaignStore functional updater support\n- Reset store in UpdateCampaign onSuccess before navigation\n- Add hierarchy/hierarchyCode clearing to resetCreateCampaignData\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Optimize 55k boundary selection performance and fix re-entry loader freeze\n\nShow loader during Select All and on re-entering boundary selection with\nlarge pre-existing data. Key fixes: batch state updates in handleSelectAll\nand handleCategorySelection, iterative processData instead of recursive\nO(n²) spread, batched updateBoundaryOptions into single setState, deferred\nmount rendering with double-rAF, removed expensive JSON.stringify on every\nrender.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix substring match in updateBoundaryOptions path comparison\n\nUse split(\".\").includes(code) instead of includes(code) to match\ncomplete path segments and prevent false positives (e.g., parent code\n\"12\" incorrectly matching path \"112.abc\").\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix single-select duplicate codes and preserve frozen selections on bulk deselect\n\nUse boundary key (subkey) as option code in single-select dropdown\ninstead of parent code from path split, preventing sibling boundaries\nfrom sharing the same code. Preserve frozen selections during Deselect\nAll and category deselection by checking frozenCodesSet before removal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Remove globalConfig hierarchyType dependency from health-payments module\n\nDerive hierarchyType from project.additionalDetails and lowestBoundaryLevel\nfrom boundary hierarchy definition API instead of hardcoding from\nwindow.globalConfigs and paymentsConfig MDMS. Pass both values via React\nContext (ProviderContext) and load boundary localizations at screen level.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Add input validation and character limits for drawer field properties and page headers\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix CodeRabbit review issues - move number min clamping to blur, connect virtualized list keyboard nav, clean up unused import\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Fix dropdown scrollbar for single option and Select All state sync on boundary clear\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Add polling for campaign search persistence verification after delivery rules update and unified sheet upload\n\n* FEATURE/HCMPRE-4169 : Add boundary summary persistence polling and fix dropdown scrollbar\n\n- Add persistence polling to BoundarySummary (key=6) with fingerprint comparison\n  against update request payload, retrying up to 3 times with 5-second gaps\n- Store boundary fingerprint in SetupCampaign before calling update API\n- Fix horizontal scrollbar in MultiSelectDropdown by adding overflowX hidden to\n  react-window List component\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXe0VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAui0QABAnAsRLuLIa1/bR7IqE7LVH\nTLPuoULSJ3fu75sQShADDW8iqhFhVohEXfO2G57fwYw7gN5pdfQJ/RhhrpjNfII3\nbEeiczGtCbgZe5isMWStPHC6ra3/HvO0geDv24JIz5R+8gs4rI6kryNob4dSOMun\nGW1VLh4O5xBH/LLAFuFynHS7XqltFATeW7g4AsLz/s5qH2n27evmmer0QpaNOCYl\nBeH1iSg9Ez8kD