hna-egov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ramkrishna-egov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/commits/4aa2127073b7311e70b5d8ddfea081d55e13e564/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T04:32:42Z","email":"85437265+Ramkrishna-egov@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ramkrishna-egov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T04:32:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"BUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Remove MDMS hierarchy type dependency from Commodity Management (#4166)\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Remove MDMS hierarchy type dependency from CommodityManagement\n\n- Replace MDMS-based hierarchyType lookup with campaign-derived hierarchyType in NewShipmentPopup and BulkStockUpload\n- Remove hierarchy/authorization logic from CommodityProjectContext, resolve hierarchyType from project.additionalDetails in CommodityDashboard\n- Simplify ProjectStaffGuard to only check hasStaff, remove isAuthorizedForCommodity gate\n- Pass sortedHierarchy as prop to StockSummaryTab instead of context\n- Fix projectId priority in NewShipmentPopup (prefer prop over campaign search)\n- Use .env template variable for global config in index.html files\n- Fix webpack.dev proxy to use REACT_APP_PROXY_API env var\n- Add Windows compatibility to start-dev.js\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Address CodeRabbit review comments\n\n- Scope userBoundary to selectedProject instead of first project in context\n- Add hierarchyLoading to dashboard loading gate to prevent flash of wrong isTopLevel\n- Remove process.exit(0) from SIGINT handler for graceful child-process cleanup\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Remove literal quotes from concurrently commands in start-dev.js","tree":{"sha":"474da081bde9f690f41c16d8469349576020d56c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/trees/474da081bde9f690f41c16d8469349576020d56c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/egovernments/DIGIT-Frontend/git/commits/4aa2127073b7311e70b5d8ddfea081d55e13e564","verification":{"payload":"tree 474da081bde9f690f41c16d8469349576020d56c\nparent 9931306b03545c416ed8c64ea3bc19d375f792ae\nauthor Ramkrishna-egov <85437265+Ramkrishna-egov@users.noreply.github.com> 1784262762 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784262762 +0530\n\nBUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Remove MDMS hierarchy type dependency from Commodity Management (#4166)\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Remove MDMS hierarchy type dependency from CommodityManagement\n\n- Replace MDMS-based hierarchyType lookup with campaign-derived hierarchyType in NewShipmentPopup and BulkStockUpload\n- Remove hierarchy/authorization logic from CommodityProjectContext, resolve hierarchyType from project.additionalDetails in CommodityDashboard\n- Simplify ProjectStaffGuard to only check hasStaff, remove isAuthorizedForCommodity gate\n- Pass sortedHierarchy as prop to StockSummaryTab instead of context\n- Fix projectId priority in NewShipmentPopup (prefer prop over campaign search)\n- Use .env template variable for global config in index.html files\n- Fix webpack.dev proxy to use REACT_APP_PROXY_API env var\n- Add Windows compatibility to start-dev.js\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Address CodeRabbit review comments\n\n- Scope userBoundary to selectedProject instead of first project in context\n- Add hierarchyLoading to dashboard loading gate to prevent flash of wrong isTopLevel\n- Remove process.exit(0) from SIGINT handler for graceful child-process cleanup\n\n* BUGFIX/HCMPRE-9009 : Remove literal quotes from concurrently commands in start-dev.js","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJq