{"date":"2026-07-10T23:06:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:06:47Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"remove URL rewrite engine\n\nDeletes rewrite.rs (953 lines of named-parameter, glob, brace-expansion\nand capture-group matching), its 18-test integration suite, the\nrewrites/redirects config fields, and the regex dependency. --single SPA\nfallback and cleanUrls cover local-dev routing; the file handler is now\na straight serve -> clean-URL -> index.html chain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF","tree":{"sha":"49120bed677ade1ed0b891363044c18fa15c5fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/trees/49120bed677ade1ed0b891363044c18fa15c5fc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/commits/f0bf05ed5b223db8185a7cb32157f36faa08940b","verification":{"payload":"tree 49120bed677ade1ed0b891363044c18fa15c5fc0\nparent 4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724807 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724807 +0000\n\nremove URL rewrite engine\n\nDeletes rewrite.rs (953 lines of named-parameter, glob, brace-expansion\nand capture-group matching), its 18-test integration suite, the\nrewrites/redirects config fields, and the regex dependency. --single SPA\nfallback and cleanUrls cover local-dev routing; the file handler is now\na straight serve -> clean-URL -> index.html chain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQM4B3qmV\n+YKJjQq72ed3mLTGTVkOQRDs+3KgJGukHsUCFAe2hOiTuCwMwSxoT6Bsza8hIbtNAXgTGbS9dWh7\nEg8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-10T23:17:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/f0bf05ed5b223db8185a7cb32157f36faa08940b","node_id":"C_kwDOKV9w2doAKGYwYmYwNWVkNWIyMjNkYjgxODVhN2NiMzIxNTdmMzZmYWEwODk0MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2","sha":"4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2"}],"sha":"f0bf05ed5b223db8185a7cb32157f36faa08940b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/f0bf05ed5b223db8185a7cb32157f36faa08940b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:01:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:01:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"delete shutdown.rs, rely on actix built-in signal handling\n\nShutdownManager was entirely dead code and setup_basic_signal_handling\nduplicated what actix-web already does on SIGINT/SIGTERM: stop accepting\nconnections and drain in-flight requests. shutdown_timeout(5) keeps the\nold 5-second force-shutdown cap. Drops signal-hook and\nsignal-hook-tokio. Verified live: SIGINT exits 0 with a clean drain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF","tree":{"sha":"4407b6f5386bc670c8eb0fe8cc38446d981b1018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/trees/4407b6f5386bc670c8eb0fe8cc38446d981b1018"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/commits/4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2","verification":{"payload":"tree 4407b6f5386bc670c8eb0fe8cc38446d981b1018\nparent c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724492 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724492 +0000\n\ndelete shutdown.rs, rely on actix built-in signal handling\n\nShutdownManager was entirely dead code and setup_basic_signal_handling\nduplicated what actix-web already does on SIGINT/SIGTERM: stop accepting\nconnections and drain in-flight requests. shutdown_timeout(5) keeps the\nold 5-second force-shutdown cap. Drops signal-hook and\nsignal-hook-tokio. Verified live: SIGINT exits 0 with a clean drain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC0mnbmY\nFipkAflEahJsraFrLHJ0pU2IanJf+G+lREGJb7a4zDxsBJA1YL609ztZO+bOgWJK8TbhJKqXnVud\ngwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-10T23:17:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2","node_id":"C_kwDOKV9w2doAKDRmOTliNjUzODlkZjk3OTVmNzQxZjhkYzIzYTRjM2FhZWQ2YTEwYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d","sha":"c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d"}],"sha":"4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/4f99b65389df9795f741f8dc23a4c3aaed6a10a2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:00:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T23:00:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"consolidate logging into one sink, drop env_logger\n\nmain.rs used to initialize env_logger alongside the custom colored\nlogger, producing two overlapping output streams. The custom logger now\nregisters itself as the log-crate facade, so log::info!/warn!/error!\nfrom any module (including actix) flow through the same colored,\ntimestamped output. The per-POST info line is downgraded to debug since\nthe HTTP middleware already logs every request. Unused convenience\nmacros and redundant tests removed (581 -> ~380 lines).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF","tree":{"sha":"679fafe4cdc1b8001340d7461f9861d54432efb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/trees/679fafe4cdc1b8001340d7461f9861d54432efb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/commits/c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d","verification":{"payload":"tree 679fafe4cdc1b8001340d7461f9861d54432efb7\nparent 1f3eef73f71779120e59bdf06e80a01937f2cb64\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724405 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724405 +0000\n\nconsolidate logging into one sink, drop env_logger\n\nmain.rs used to initialize env_logger alongside the custom colored\nlogger, producing two overlapping output streams. The custom logger now\nregisters itself as the log-crate facade, so log::info!/warn!/error!\nfrom any module (including actix) flow through the same colored,\ntimestamped output. The per-POST info line is downgraded to debug since\nthe HTTP middleware already logs every request. Unused convenience\nmacros and redundant tests removed (581 -> ~380 lines).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBKdPBDN\n/2aOFoBcgNBitXa0nHqzPYtb2WkT9d8VgLASsqoz5PL0v8XWXRN8SLtratow24lVbHP63N2Z5OGk\nIgk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-10T23:17:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d","node_id":"C_kwDOKV9w2doAKGM2NWQ1NThhMjk5MzJlNTU0NTQ2ZTlmYmZhNWRiODc2N2E0ZDdjNGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/1f3eef73f71779120e59bdf06e80a01937f2cb64","sha":"1f3eef73f71779120e59bdf06e80a01937f2cb64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/1f3eef73f71779120e59bdf06e80a01937f2cb64"}],"sha":"c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/c65d558a29932e554546e9fbfa5db8767a4d7c4d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/1f3eef73f71779120e59bdf06e80a01937f2cb64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:57:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:57:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"add --ssl flag: HTTPS with auto-generated self-signed certificate\n\nPromotes rcgen from dev-dependency to dependency and generates an\nin-memory ECDSA P-256 certificate for localhost/127.0.0.1/::1 at\nstartup. No certificate files to create or wrangle for local HTTPS\ntesting; --ssl-cert/--ssl-key still work for real certificates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF","tree":{"sha":"d77700337055e227258ee7219c16b713acd8471d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/trees/d77700337055e227258ee7219c16b713acd8471d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/commits/1f3eef73f71779120e59bdf06e80a01937f2cb64","verification":{"payload":"tree d77700337055e227258ee7219c16b713acd8471d\nparent 3ae28eb5526c82d61a03b7c78307f458ca4d573e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724276 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724276 +0000\n\nadd --ssl flag: HTTPS with auto-generated self-signed certificate\n\nPromotes rcgen from dev-dependency to dependency and generates an\nin-memory ECDSA P-256 certificate for localhost/127.0.0.1/::1 at\nstartup. No certificate files to create or wrangle for local HTTPS\ntesting; --ssl-cert/--ssl-key still work for real certificates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH S