ttps://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/3ae28eb5526c82d61a03b7c78307f458ca4d573e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:55:41Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:55:41Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"slim TLS to PEM-only, drop PKCS12 and passphrase support\n\nTlsConfig is now a plain struct with required cert and key paths, so the\n''validated elsewhere'' unwrap on key_path is gone — the type encodes the\ninvariant. Removes p12-keystore, --ssl-pass, format detection, and the\nPKCS12 test helpers (whose integration test was already broken).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF","tree":{"sha":"a60d088a8fb9f751878df13ec2c7c5c59edfcdf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/trees/a60d088a8fb9f751878df13ec2c7c5c59edfcdf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/commits/3ae28eb5526c82d61a03b7c78307f458ca4d573e","verification":{"payload":"tree a60d088a8fb9f751878df13ec2c7c5c59edfcdf7\nparent 393343bfb35c65432448b1b647737b4b88bf4e77\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724141 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724141 +0000\n\nslim TLS to PEM-only, drop PKCS12 and passphrase support\n\nTlsConfig is now a plain struct with required cert and key paths, so the\n''validated elsewhere'' unwrap on key_path is gone — the type encodes the\ninvariant. Removes p12-keystore, --ssl-pass, format detection, and the\nPKCS12 test helpers (whose integration test was already broken).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIkIY9LL\nJxXLk/1xK8ebgCrbeI29M2XWnbsAtz01Ax2IgxTBatLdc2TDhC1yM0M+LrdSXHtzsPAs1H56NRbG\nXw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-10T23:17:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/3ae28eb5526c82d61a03b7c78307f458ca4d573e","node_id":"C_kwDOKV9w2doAKDNhZTI4ZWI1NTI2YzgyZDYxYTAzYjdjNzgzMDdmNDU4Y2E0ZDU3M2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/y-a-v-a/msaada/commit/393343bfb35c65432448b1b647737b4b88bf4e77","sha":"393343bfb35c65432448b1b647737b4b88bf4e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/393343bfb35c65432448b1b647737b4b88bf4e77"}],"sha":"3ae28eb5526c82d61a03b7c78307f458ca4d573e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/3ae28eb5526c82d61a03b7c78307f458ca4d573e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/393343bfb35c65432448b1b647737b4b88bf4e77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:53:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:53:42Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"make network_ports tests robust when running as root\n\nTwo sub-tests spawned msaada with Command::output() expecting a startup\nfailure (privileged port 80, unreadable directory). As root both starts\nsucceed, the server never exits, and output() blocks the suite forever.\nA helper now waits with a timeout and treats a still-running server as\nthe root-success outcome, killing it before returning.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF","tree":{"sha":"1061c7205fa228bbd90c0458565bb74e2f7b961a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/trees/1061c7205fa228bbd90c0458565bb74e2f7b961a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/commits/393343bfb35c65432448b1b647737b4b88bf4e77","verification":{"payload":"tree 1061c7205fa228bbd90c0458565bb74e2f7b961a\nparent cbff6503a3e6617519967609a3f0780ae699b98c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724022 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783724022 +0000\n\nmake network_ports tests robust when running as root\n\nTwo sub-tests spawned msaada with Command::output() expecting a startup\nfailure (privileged port 80, unreadable directory). As root both starts\nsucceed, the server never exits, and output() blocks the suite forever.\nA helper now waits with a timeout and treats a still-running server as\nthe root-success outcome, killing it before returning.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLSdSBg5\nNW5J82eusL0KCltdAS0MurlrfGTkHSYGe1uR4u4Wdi3fyXMRE9VhbrDFnwx1anEaISYF8Qsv1En8\nIQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-10T23:17:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","g