i.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/commits/cbff6503a3e6617519967609a3f0780ae699b98c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:52:03Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T22:52:03Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"remove clipboard integration\n\nDeletes clipboard.rs, the --no-clipboard flag, and the URL auto-copy at\nstartup. A local dev server doesn''t need to shell out to wl-copy/xclip/\npbcopy; the URL is printed (and clickable) in the terminal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF","tree":{"sha":"b67f41d7c999dadd77cc86ce0d1e8c40c2d34e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/trees/b67f41d7c999dadd77cc86ce0d1e8c40c2d34e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/y-a-v-a/msaada/git/commits/cbff6503a3e6617519967609a3f0780ae699b98c","verification":{"payload":"tree b67f41d7c999dadd77cc86ce0d1e8c40c2d34e46\nparent 8cdbbebdb78fbcbe369d8753c53154bb0be1f4d7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783723923 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783723923 +0000\n\nremove clipboard integration\n\nDeletes clipboard.rs, the --no-clipboard flag, and the URL auto-copy at\nstartup. A local dev server doesn''t need to shell out to wl-copy/xclip/\npbcopy; the URL is printed (and clickable) in the terminal.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CDpyJ9Qeffb8hUd6By75eF\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQORiAciZ\nt578+Nkv6LxBZ8eOd1l2GJMw3hfzozrMJtdBPlqveJj4OKL1o/sXAHCzHajndBML/sVcks0ARBBr\nBg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_a