":"2026-03-06T07:58:10Z","email":"264880129+react-server-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"react-server-bot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T07:58:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: upgrade Vitest 4.1.0-beta.6 (#340)\n\nAutomated daily upgrade of Vite, Rolldown, and/or Vitest to the latest\navailable versions.\n\n**Vitest:** `4.1.0-beta.5` → `4.1.0-beta.6`\n\n### Updated locations\n- `packages/react-server/package.json` — `vite`, `rolldown`\n- `test/package.json` — `vite`, `rolldown`, `vitest`, `@vitest/ui`\n- `packages/rsc/package.json` — `vitest`, `@vitest/*`\n- `packages/create-react-server/test/package.json` — `vitest`\n- `package.json` — all `pnpm.overrides` for Vite\n- `pnpm-lock.yaml`\n\n### Smoke test\n- Dev mode — `hello world` test passed ✅\n- Build+start mode — `hello world` test passed ✅\n\nCo-authored-by: lazarv <1749493+lazarv@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Viktor Lázár <lazarv1982@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"22d5211dca63afdce630979951faa2a976affce3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/trees/22d5211dca63afdce630979951faa2a976affce3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/commits/04f2240731c2afbd012747670f694eb74385d9ad","verification":{"payload":"tree 22d5211dca63afdce630979951faa2a976affce3\nparent 4b8cccbc8831213c042e959939cfc9e7e701e10a\nauthor react-server-bot[bot] <264880129+react-server-bot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1772783890 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772783890 +0100\n\nchore: upgrade Vitest 4.1.0-beta.6 (#340)\n\nAutomated daily upgrade of Vite, Rolldown, and/or Vitest to the latest\navailable versions.\n\n**Vitest:** `4.1.0-beta.5` → `4.1.0-beta.6`\n\n### Updated locations\n- `packages/react-server/package.json` — `vite`, `rolldown`\n- `test/package.json` — `vite`, `rolldown`, `vitest`, `@vitest/ui`\n- `packages/rsc/package.json` — `vitest`, `@vitest/*`\n- `packages/create-react-server/test/packag