server/commits/d311e2f2ca8db911d7c6cd613f37115788575635/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-05T20:38:28Z","email":"lazarv1982@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Lázár"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-05T20:38:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: use root-relative URLs for in-project client component modules in dev (#337)\n\nIn dev mode, client component modules were always loaded via\n`/@fs/<cwd>/...` URLs (both in `__webpack_require__` and `<link\nrel=\"modulepreload\">`). However, Vite''s module graph normalizes\nin-project files to root-relative URLs (e.g., `/app/providers.jsx`).\nThis URL mismatch caused the browser to load the same module twice, once\nat `/@fs/...` and again at the root-relative path with a `?t=`\ncache-bust timestamp from Vite''s HMR/dep optimization.","tree":{"sha":"8ffcf5a106faf07969c26351144ffae6954e4680","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/trees/8ffcf5a106faf07969c26351144ffae6954e4680"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/commits/d311e2f2ca8db911d7c6cd613f37115788575635","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ffcf5a106faf07969c26351144ffae6954e4680\nparent 674986842ce8213373f8593c1dd50bad45f3bb88\nauthor Viktor Lázár <lazarv1982@gmail.com> 1772743108 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772743108 +0100\n\nfix: use root-relative URLs for in-project client component modules in dev (#337)\n\nIn dev mode, client component modules were always loaded via\n`/@fs/<cwd>/...` URLs (both in `__webpack_require__` and `<link\nrel=\"modulepreload\">`). However, Vite''s module graph normalizes\nin-project files to root-relative URLs (e.g., `/app/providers.jsx`).\nThis URL mismatch caused the browser to load the same module twice, once\nat `/@fs/...` and again at the root-relative path with a `?t=`\ncache-bust timestamp from Vite''s HMR/dep optimization.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqenECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAPYQA