4986842ce8213373f8593c1dd50bad45f3bb88","sha":"674986842ce8213373f8593c1dd50bad45f3bb88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/commits/674986842ce8213373f8593c1dd50bad45f3bb88"}],"sha":"d311e2f2ca8db911d7c6cd613f37115788575635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/commits/d311e2f2ca8db911d7c6cd613f37115788575635"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1749493?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lazarv","id":1749493,"login":"lazarv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDk0OTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/commits/674986842ce8213373f8593c1dd50bad45f3bb88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-04T22:39:47Z","email":"lazarv1982@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Lázár"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-04T22:39:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: singlefile adapter (#333)\n\nAdds a new **singlefile** adapter that bundles a statically exported\nReact application into a single, self-contained HTML file. All CSS and\nJavaScript modules are inlined — no external resources are fetched at\nruntime.\n\n## Motivation\n\nThis adapter is useful for:\n\n- **Offline-capable apps** that work from a `file://` URL or a single\nHTTP request\n- **Portable demos** or prototypes you can share as a single file\n- **Embedding** in environments where only one HTML file is allowed\n(e.g. email attachments, embedded webviews)\n\n## How it works\n\n1. **Static export** — Forces `--export` of the `\"/\"` route to produce\n`index.html`\n2. **CSS inlining** — Replaces `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` tags with\ninline `<style>` blocks; CSS references in RSC flight data are converted\nto `data:text/css;base64,...` URIs so React''s runtime stylesheet\ncreation still works\n3. **JS module inlining** — All client ES modules are base64-encoded,\nembedded in a boot `<script>`, and decoded at runtime into blob URLs\nwired through a dynamic [import\nmap](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/script/type/importmap)\n4. **Import rewriting** — Relative imports are resolved to absolute\npaths, then converted to bare specifiers so they resolve correctly from\nblob URL modules\n5. **Cleanup** — Modulepreload hints, dev-only live-reload links, and\nthe static import map are removed\n\n### Usage\n\n```sh\npnpm react-server build ./src/index.jsx --adapter singlefile\n```\n\nOr via config:\n\n```mjs\nexport default {\n  adapter: \"singlefile\",\n};\n```\n\nOutput: `dist/index.html` — a single file containing everything.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- **Single route only** — Only the `\"/\"` path is exported\n- **No server-side features** — Server actions, API routes, and dynamic\nrendering are not available\n- **File size overhead** — Base64 encoding adds ~33% to JS module sizes\n- **SPA mode recommended** — Works best with single-page applications\nusing client components\n\n> **Note:** This adapter is marked as **experimental** and may change in\nfuture releases.","tree":{"sha":"dbe87323d38d2e73f53d3a451cb0f31d9f8f70b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/trees/dbe87323d38d2e73f53d3a451cb0f31d9f8f70b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/commits/674986842ce8213373f8593c1dd50bad45f3bb88","verification":{"payload":"tree dbe87323d38d2e73f53d3a451cb0f31d9f8f70b2\nparent de92f349ee065e2192c634b59f86044d42aaa044\nauthor Viktor Lázár <lazarv1982@gmail.com> 1772663987 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772663987 +0100\n\nfeat: singlefile adapter (#333)\n\nAdds a new **singlefile** adapter that bundles a statically exported\nReact application into a single, self-contained HTML file. All CSS and\nJavaScript modules are inlined — no external resources are fetched at\nruntime.\n\n## Motivation\n\nThis adapter is useful for:\n\n- **Offline-capable apps** that work from a `file://` URL or a single\nHTTP request\n- **Portable demos** or prototypes you can share as a single file\n- **Embedding** in environments where only one HTML file is allowed\n(e.g. email attachments, embedded webviews)\n\n## How it works\n\n1. **Static export** — Forces `--export` of the `\"/\"` route to produce\n`index.html`\n2. **CSS inlining** — Replaces `<link rel=\"stylesheet\">` tags with\ninline `<style>` blocks; CSS references in RSC flight data are converted\nto `data:text/css;base64,...` URIs so React''s runtime stylesheet\ncreation still works\n3. **JS module inlining** — All client ES modules are base64-encoded,\nembedded in a boot `<script>`, and decoded at runtime into blob URLs\nwired through a dynamic [import\nmap](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/script/type/importmap)\n4. **Import rewriting** — Relative imports are resolved to absolute\npaths, then converted to bare specifiers so they resolve correctly from\nblob URL modules\n5. **Cleanup** — Modulepreload hints, dev-only live-reload links, and\nthe static import map are removed\n\n### Usage\n\n```sh\npnpm react-server build ./src/index.jsx --adapter singlefile\n```\n\nOr via config:\n\n```mjs\nexport default {\n  adapter: \"singlefile\",\n};\n```\n\nOutput: `dist/index.html` — a single file containing everything.\n\n## Limitations\n\n- **Single route only** — Only the `\"/\"` path is exported\n- **No server-side features** — Server actions, API routes, and dynamic\nrendering are not available\n- **File size overhead** — Base64 encoding adds ~33% to JS module sizes\n- **SPA mode recommended** — Works best with single-page applications\nusing client components\n\n> **Note:** This adapter is marked as **experimental** and may change in\nfuture releases.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpqLSzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALXIQAHp2daYYZ1umNorX7T5hgqI3\nToV20ryFCG26brtocWVK/r+EkB0q/H7Dy2C6sokq3KKttbixz+xMe1zD3ciYhDgY\nlBvS3FsoX/MnNtMX00VE3u7TK18HLI6KJrFN+nq29ToZ2pa6M59Mpei6ArBlryN3\ndKKKApf6lPbagDacJ0zjbaRQ9F3fInehN8PpB0TGyRKw2nLslJptr192xbcg1jMg\nwkJ7+vGYWnM/+hY6czuuvmHZC7GDq7natVOiAC/NCLasWNwyYrFFKRjebIhIer8A\nIjmfpxl5oXgXeIrwR+4YcaAfIBIw05GjQS/pLBHfhPDyL3DQ8e8gbGX0R5jTEd60\nPVZN+Y9VVhVnhYlr0frdQ3yPX9RX76ywgHe28enAt7kU4/hh4wt1g/TPFu/8nso4\neELtH0O0qnosX0SrEMG+PN8Z6u5CbjxBFmBFjjwEI82HIWdHb6EQuZfNVbW2Ij6e\nnNLq6V5b0ExjVLPT2WbsHgQrk9QKQxeapwr1hqsYGJUhy9ta/FkRkoKNKC3BmsHk\nHcMSgzXg4KA4yHcqQCWF2gEWOWGAdimKMskMo9kQ+2dikSOTFvYQeniQMRtt+9TN\nH24c8Lx9Fz/K78ARclVaM7F37Ddhzw6KgnGISAZkeYMvwkL3qDMLyNwlBBw1dpcY\nCSeqL1asEyHiOuQQzKxt\n=nRFI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-04T22:39:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":f