itter":{"date":"2026-03-03T23:24:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: adapter entry (#331)\n\nExtracts the duplicated request handling logic from all\nadapter-generated entry files into a single shared module\n(`adapters/shared/edge-handler.mjs`), eliminating ~450 lines of\ncopy-pasted code across 10 deployment adapters.\n\n## Motivation\n\nEvery adapter (AWS, Azure, Azure SWA, Bun, Cloudflare, Deno, Docker,\nFirebase, Netlify Edge, Netlify Node) and the default edge entry had\ntheir own independent copy of the same core logic:\n\n- Lazy initialization of the `reactServer()` instance\n- HTTP context creation via `createContext()`\n- 404 response handling when response is `null`\n- `set-cookie` header propagation from `httpContext._setCookies`\n- Error catching with 500 response fallback\n\nThis duplication meant that any behavioral change or bug fix had to be\nreplicated across 10+ files, making maintenance error-prone.","tree":{"sha":"ee363562de68ecb3b32efd2adea80d7071c443e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/trees/ee363562de68ecb3b32efd2adea80d7071c443e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/commits/0f76cb92e9d2848a194f71b3a3e29b81daa08d2b","verification":{"payload":"tree ee363562de68ecb3b32efd2adea80d7071c443e6\nparent 4bce46b260f6a551762ecca9524056faf2be3b02\nauthor Viktor Lázár <lazarv1982@gmail.com> 1772580287 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772580287 +0100\n\nrefactor: adapter entry (#331)\n\nExtracts the duplicated request handling logic from all\nadapter-generated entry files into a single shared module\n(`adapters/shared/edge-handler.mjs`), eliminating ~450 lines of\ncopy-pasted code across 10 deployment adapters.\n\n## Motivation\n\nEvery adapter (AWS, Azure, Azure SWA, Bun, Cloudflare, Deno, Docker,\nFirebase, Netlify Edge, Netlify Node) and the default edge entry had\ntheir own independent copy of the same core logic:\n\n- Lazy initialization of the `reactServer()` instance\n- HTTP context creation via `createContext()`\n- 404 response handling when response is `null`\n- `set-cookie` header propagation from `httpContext._setCookies`\n- Error catching with 500 response fallback\n\nThis duplication meant that any behavioral change or bug fix had to be\nreplicated across 10+ files, making maintenance error-prone.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpp22/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABo0QAHPhZNOrT7Cx+dhVmDljhjlV\nZmqnhgCce1HFHFu4GdJfkJhObEyaR6K3qqdu9wvuWhIbg9CK49fgP/YZy0gww7l7\nfIALGYniIj6Nd7hzPnPgJtIfTCuL/v2xCOO/iNN6s0nQO/EWMY3I9gRXIkRwj+3f\nG1Sg8hSW2zXS5Jz+BBO/9277hWJWcM+LdDcRzKLnVjoQ5p4aHMiGnIxzZreCpdjL\n2N64Hq971cIF3NoWe6GKjZeEOwGLTd/jWFHtAtjDoufNop6BX9evUowc+SQOUxq5\nKWDjqORnncNf+Fjaw1N9J0E/JDSwiuNEGNccHz1bmyaXJlYGhawkXYpkrFh7lppi\n9VhJhWGPYJu/4JTmMU7mpDdHi/MfOyF9mhb111AjL91E010IIVDbR91DuRAbUwc2\n+uJTWYwvuVkbzNz4ghGMIulC7J9ASrg8/Y9Q5tC/Vw3Hjg8FmmZ2SRwOE9a0V/7/\nMv1sRfQCq0tpA/n25yQjOKY8GMdghskNxDYksmYOojDOG3IC/4CWOx/nvvut0oWo\n82ya++gXaFHOWuiS2ggaXx+2OV2/ZrrtIdzpkvRnBUZnwSeOweUmIzMbv5lBINdn\n1lpQuQH/olpjiQTgsvxXFJ/G9WG6So+H4DxJtd3q0fQy7oAzdFq1Q7HLKiJjTvNP\nO+1LuZnsuV8T+8yz5f61\n=N5P/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-03T23:24:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lazarv/react-server/commit/0f76cb92e9d2848a194f71b3a3e29b81daa08d2b","node_id":"C_kwDOKWnYDNoAKDBmNzZjYjkyZTlkMjg0OGExOTRmNzFiM2EzZTI5YjgxZGFhMDhkMmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lazarv/react-server/commit/4bce46b260f6a551762ecca9524056faf2be3b02","sha":"4bce46b260f6a551762ecca9524056faf2be3b02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/commits/4bce46b260f6a551762ecca9524056faf2be3b02"}],"sha":"0f76cb92e9d2848a194f71b3a3e29b81daa08d2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/commits/0f76cb92e9d2848a194f71b3a3e29b81daa08d2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1749493?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lazarv","id":1749493,"login":"lazarv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDk0OTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lazarv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/commits/4bce46b260f6a551762ecca9524056faf2be3b02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T21:20:18Z","email":"lazarv1982@gmail.com","name":"Viktor Lázár"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T21:20:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: features category (#330)\n\n### What\n\n- Rename the \"Framework\" docs category to \"Features\" across all pages\n(en/ja), navigation, messages, and config\n- Add raw markdown (`.md`) endpoints for all docs pages, accessible via\n`/{path}.md` (e.g. `/guide/quick-start.md`)\n- Add a small \".md\" button on all docs content pages linking to the raw\nmarkdown version\n- Add `llms.txt` to the public directory for AI/LLM discovery\n- Update README and CONTRIBUTING docs\n\n### Why\n\n- \"Features\" better describes the section''s content\n- Raw markdown pages provide clean, JSX-free content for AI agents,\nLLMs, and crawlers\n- `llms.txt` follows the emerging convention for LLM-friendly site\nmetadata\n\n### How\n\n- Moved all `framework/` page files to `features/` and updated all\ninternal links and frontmatter references\n- Added an API route (`md/GET.[...slug].server.mjs`) that reads MDX\nsources, strips frontmatter/imports/JSX, and returns plain markdown\n- Middleware rewrites `.md` requests to the internal `/md/` route\n- Static export config generates `.md` files for all docs pages at build\ntime\n- Added `ViewMarkdown` button component to the root layout","tree":{"sha":"8d3217f2ea81b477fd7d077fc16aaa950fc3930f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/trees/8d3217f2ea81b477fd7d077fc16aaa950fc3930f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lazarv/react-server/git/commits/4bce46b260f6a551762ecca9524056faf2be3b02","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d3217f2ea81b477fd7d077fc16aaa950fc3930f\nparent 6b6d07f132602ca3db0adfc7b1f5cfb49d0fa750\nauthor Viktor Lázár <lazarv1982@gmail.com> 1772572818 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772572818 +0100\n\ndocs: features category (#330)\n\n### What\n\n- Rename the \"Framework\" docs category to \"Features\" across all pages\n(en/ja), navigation, messages, and config\n- Add raw markdown (`.md`) endpoints for all docs pages, accessible via\n`/{path}.md` (e.g. `/guide/quick-start.md`)\n- Add a small \".md\" button on all docs content pages linking to the raw\nmarkdown version\n- Add `llms.txt` to the public directory for AI/LLM discovery\n- Update README and CONTRIBUTING docs\n\n### Why\n\n- \"Features\" better describes the section''s content\n- Raw markdown pages provide clean, JSX-free content for AI agents,\nLLMs, and crawlers\n- `llms.txt` follows the emerging convention for LLM-friendly site\nmetadata\n\n### How\n\n- Moved all `framework/` page files to `features/` and updated all\ninternal links and frontmatter references\n- Added an API route (`md/GET.[...slug].server.mjs`) that reads MDX\nsources, strips frontmatter/imports/JSX, and returns plain markdown\n- Middleware rewrites `.md` requests to the internal `/md/` route\n- Static export config generates `.md` files for all docs pages at build\ntime\n- Added `ViewMarkdown` button component to the root layout","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpp1CSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8ocQAA0XLs8BdDwb0ZEA2IRNi6mV\nj4KO/OpheU3OPRwbfZ1uxcg9P490kc32RNRDPHif43VqYurVG4/TgBGHTVUfuRy5\nCXyiA4igMsSTul4xPuMXyh83TqN8ikn0YuoIx9tMzMwI0br2LtZ2lTjn/Vtb1Dj5\nXK6OiXYhzksKec3oKi2GB/DNQ6PU1mOnZkEhoFno1OHMpdfBiAllNsjPkQsDNEVV\niSzp9508Ucje/Xhb1SUdRED2kt+aE6EhApNLnlRvD1+Y9M4fwzlDGSoyM4MCASTs\nXH2TTNhUV79mF9oDPmEuDZgtAawDoGgks5TbmpgjZYp6vYHZam5aOlHDzp7rLfP2\nmpOvCkiK6+O4/zGIhKYbw2ouckIjKAMQ12JU4DgvrM/ETftVvtsSNebZEcCVzNGM\n3ivatlml0PVWsB+mQcUd1m3aXhnSd9KKCyRZvL5ZGbw6UPUoLmgua5DdKxu+EGDK\nS+X/c4amUblLc4USoa4Fw4v4jHfxr0FgMhS0Vgqq8XndaKLHbYTa5u/s0jP4grS9\niZC8Y155pM/huaQtfQfN23FW5eMuG2xtXVNVirNhv1EN7OJktQ71kLGZf5FbmtRU\nMU3Bd5WRjXBOjc5LWa2BMAOKJbVioRTIMzjH9BS0eksekBFHMSJ35Dl7ivn0Bim5\n7TiF5CT19rxDS/2Z2bxp\n=MP2R\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-03T21:20:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl