cheti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T23:26:49Z","email":"sachin.sancheti@gmail.com","name":"Sachin Sancheti"},"message":"feat: shareable scene links (?node=) with back/forward support\n\nThe URL now tracks the current scene, so any view can be shared and the\nbrowser''s Back button steps through visited scenes.\n\n- Server validates ?node= against the tour''s node IDs and falls back to\n  the start node (resolveInitialNodeId, unit-tested), so a stale link\n  never shows a blank tour\n- Virtual.svelte reports node-changed and accepts a requested nodeId\n  via a separate effect, so scene requests never rebuild the viewer\n- The page syncs via shallow routing. The scene per history entry lives\n  in page.state because SvelteKit keeps page.url at the loaded URL\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb7d022d00a77cd204da1526701c4416ba45df9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachinsancheti1/sanity-template-sveltekit-photo-sphere-viewer/git/trees/cb7d022d00a77cd204da1526701c4416ba45df9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachinsancheti1/sanity-template-sveltekit-photo-sphere-viewer/git/commits/45133b9aafa1871492434094dd6b145cfb1bf81a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6279770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sachinsancheti1","id":6279770,"login":"sachinsancheti1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzk3NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/received_events",