16\n\n- Virtual.svelte imports PSV dynamically inside its effect, with a\n  cancelled flag so an unmount mid-load never creates a viewer. Page\n  route JS drops from 648 kB to 4 kB.\n- CI workflow: app test/check/build + studio build on every PR.\n- Dependabot replaces the non-functional Renovate config (it extended\n  Sanity''s private preset); CODEOWNERS now points at the repo owner.\n- Sanity 6.9.1 -> 6.16.0, react/react-dom aligned at 19.3.0, scoped\n  adm-zip override for a new CLI-tooling advisory.\n- typegen script passes --force (required by the newer CLI).\n- Docs: CHANGELOG v2.1.0, CLAUDE.md maintenance notes and corrected\n  typegen root cause. Version bump to 2.1.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"553e76c80c5f1ed3dc525a3c8a0a422dcebea3ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachinsancheti1/sanity-template-sveltekit-photo-sphere-viewer/git/trees/553e76c80c5f1ed3dc525a3c8a0a422dcebea3ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachinsancheti1/sanity-template-sveltekit-photo-sphere-viewer/git/commits/575afd2e2f6904012d8f3116940654b1e8a00042","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6279770?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sachinsancheti1","id":6279770,"login":"sachinsancheti1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzk3NzA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"htt