:"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinsancheti1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachinsancheti1/turbo-telegram/commits/0feb4ae64cd3d03de5667a10e505335f3c3155b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:41:35Z","email":"sachin.sancheti@gmail.com","name":"Sachin Sancheti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T04:41:35Z","email":"sachin.sancheti@gmail.com","name":"Sachin Sancheti"},"message":"Update to virtual tour template v2.3.0; fix demo hotspot directions\n\nBrings the demo to the current sanity-template-sveltekit-photo-sphere-viewer\nrelease (see CHANGELOG.md). Kept from this project: the Netlify adapter\n(@sveltejs/adapter-netlify 6.0.4) and the .netlify ignore rule.\n\nFixes hotspot directions in the Key Biscayne demo data. Its textureX/Y\nwere in 4096x2048 units (to match a ?w=4096 image URL), but the images\nare 7296x3648, and the template expects coordinates in original-image\npixels (it rescales them itself when it downscales an image). The\ndeployed site already served full-size images, so every arrow pointed\nthe wrong way (e.g. 257 deg rendered as 144 deg).\nstudio/key-biscayne-tour.ndjson now holds original-pixel coordinates\n(x 7296/4096); every direction is preserved to within 0.03 deg.\n\nThe live dataset still has the old values until the file is\nre-imported (see PR description).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1457c350a5394b3f451cc8b88c3a7de555dd91fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sachinsancheti1/turbo-telegram/git/trees/1457c350a5394b3f451